# Koka: The Koka Programming Language (koka-lang.github.io); requirements/languages/koka.md
name     koka kk
keyword  fun fn val var if then else elif match return with handler effect ctl final raw import module
keyword  pub type struct alias rec open extend con interface instance inline noinline
type     int string bool char double list maybe either
builtin  True False Nothing Just println show
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */  : nested
string   " "  : escapes
prefix   r
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
upper-type
calls
